// A copy is sorted into a bin from its edition, then lent or sent to
// repair according to the bin. The bins are computed, so a choice sees
// more tokens than the run starts with.
net lanes "A copy is sorted into a bin, then lent or repaired"

@sort_in: (waiting) -copy-> [sort]
@sort_out: [sort] -copy-> (sorted)
@sort_out data cel "{'branch': binding.waiting[0].branch, 'bin': binding.waiting[0].edition}"
@lend_in: (sorted) -copy-> [lend]
@lend_out: [lend] -copy-> (loaned)
@repair_in: (sorted) -copy-> [repair]
@repair_out: [repair] -copy-> (mending)
@lend_in predicate cel "bin < 6"
@repair_in predicate cel "bin >= 6"

(waiting) port input copy
final (loaned), (mending)
